Clipwise's actual runtime footprint is the offline community-1 pipeline's
required files — Segmentation.mlmodelc, Embedding.mlmodelc, FBank.mlmodelc,
PldaRho.mlmodelc, plda-parameters.json, xvector-transform.json — which is a
subset of the scope above (the current FluidAudio release does not download
a separate PLDA.mlmodelc; the PLDA computation ships as PldaRho.mlmodelc
plus plda-parameters.json instead — worth re-confirming against a fresh
provenance.json if FluidAudio's model layout changes).

